Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:20.63,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Maintaining software isn't
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:20.63,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}free, and AI makes it cost
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:20.63,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}real money”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think there's a big
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,question about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,maintainability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:04.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's not free to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:06.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,maintain software.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Both in terms of human
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours to look at it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,previously and now with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:10.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,AI, it literally costs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.66,0:00:11.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think even with the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,latest TypeScript Rust
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,rewrite, that was a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:17.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,whole section in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Cloudflare blog post
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:19.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,about Who's going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:20.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,maintain this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:20.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,right?
